			By Lemma~\ref{l:hom} and~\ref{l:pos}, the vertices $e$, $v$, and $w$ must be in the homology classes $h-e_1-e_2$, $e_2-e_3-\dots-e_{\ell+2}$, and $e_1-e_0$, respectively.
